The C++/CUDA kernel leaf is built on a vendored subtree of the reference
stack's core and ops (ADR 0010). kernel/NOTICE and kernel/vendor/VENDOR.md
record that subtree's provenance and its upstream terms; kernel/vendor/
manifest.json pins the reference commit and the content hash of every
vendored file.
